By taking these steps proactively both within their organization as well as with third-party developers or partners under NDAs will help mitigate risks and protect Johnson Enterprises Inc.'s intellectual property rights. This would also potentially save Smith & Partners LLP's client from further legal complications while maintaining a strong ethical stance on confidentiality.
